<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
Verify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.

In `@admin/js/admin-scripts.js` around lines 107 - 111, The showNotice function is
currently injecting message directly into HTML which allows admin-side XSS;
change it to build the notice with DOM/jQuery APIs instead of string
interpolation (use $('<div>') or document.createElement to create the container,
call .addClass('wpst-notice ' + type) after validating/sanitizing the type
against an allowlist, and set the message using .text(message) rather than
embedding it in markup), then replace the contents of the .wpst-notices
container by emptying it and appending the safe node rather than using
.html(...).
```

</details>

